  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creating conditions for healthy ageing: Promoting an inclusive formal and informal health system in Zanzinar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Older persons and their relatives in the Pemba and Unguja regions of Zanzibar (Tanzania) use age-friendly health and care systems and live healthier lives in old age through an intergenerational life cycle approach.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The quality of life and well-being of older women and men including older people with impairments in Zanzibar affected by the overlapping effects of COVID-19, geriatric conditions and non-communicable diseases is improved .</narrative>
  </description>
